Ravana hears widows lament --- Ravana summons three generals --- Generals rouse troops house to house --- Chiefs salute Ravana seeking victory --- Ravana vows to send Rama and Lakshmana to Yama --- Ravana boasts of arrow clouds and beast feasts --- Eight-horse chariot comes and leaders mount --- Ravana marches through dire death omens --- Armies clash tumultuously --- Ravana slaughters scattering monkeys